    <chapter>
      <heading>
        Software documentation for the
        NSCollectionViewCompositionalLayout
        class
      </heading>
      <class name="NSCollectionViewCompositionalLayout" super="NSCollectionViewLayout" ovadd="10.11.0">
        <declared>AppKit/NSCollectionViewCompositionalLayout.h</declared>
        <desc>
          NSCollectionViewCompositionalLayout
          represents a modern, highly flexible layout system
          for collection views that allows for complex,
          compositional arrangements of content. This
          layout system enables developers to create
          sophisticated layouts by composing smaller
          layout components together, supporting varied section
          designs, orthogonal scrolling regions, and adaptive
          layouts that respond to different screen sizes and
          orientations. It provides a declarative
          approach to layout definition with powerful
          customization capabilities.
        </desc>
      </class>
    </chapter>
